                "message": "Link the files in batch conversion reports and share one report buffer\n\nThe reports of the batch conversions and dry runs named files in plain\ntext. Every file is now an Org link, so RET visits the notes that have\nissues. The new sp-batch-report module holds the link helpers and a\nread-only Org report mode (RET, n/p, g, q) that these reports share:\nsp-litnotes-titles, sp-litnotes-refs, sp-litnotes-meta fill-all,\nsp-notes-filing, and the property and keyword conversion previews.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAL5ZmmWoUzkvAu37X",
